{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "community-discord-syndata-edge-flow-v2",
  "title": "Community Discord SYN-data edge-flow v2",
  "summary": "Экспериментальная v2-попытка для Discord updater SYN-SENT: более близко к community Windows preset добавляет phase-zero SYN-data/send profiles на Discord Cloudflare edge IPs и оставляет YouTube fallback отдельно.",
  "philosophy": "windows-inspired-phase-zero-owner-experiment",
  "intendedFor": [
    "ручная проверка Discord Linux newUpdater, когда endpoint discovery показывает SYN-SENT до TLS",
    "ситуация, где v1 community-discord-youtube-edge-flow оживляет YouTube, но Discord остаётся на Checking for updates",
    "owner-selects во вкладке Стратегии; не включается автоматически"
  ],
  "workflow": [
    "inspect",
    "owner-selects",
    "plan",
    "owner-confirms",
    "execute-later",
    "owner-observes-discord-syn-sent"
  ],
  "capabilities": {
    "readsProfiles": true,
    "readsHostlists": true,
    "usesLocalBuildPlan": true,
    "executesAutomatically": false,
    "requiresSudoAtStage7": false,
    "mutatesServicesOrFirewallAtStage7": false
  },
  "notes": [
    "v1 community bridge confirmed the Linux runtime path can help YouTube, but not the Discord updater SYN-SENT path in the owner test.",
    "This v2 seed makes the Discord edge phase-zero branch explicit: payload=empty/send and syndata are placed before host-based TLS profiles.",
    "The Windows --wf-* and WinDivert raw parts are not copied; Linux nftables still decides which packets enter NFQUEUE.",
    "This remains an experiment. If SYN-SENT continues while this strategy is active, the next suspect is nft queue scope/priority or a technique not represented by nfqws2 on Linux."
  ],
